{"type":"npc","name":"Forgemaster","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":400,"temp":0,"max":400,"details":""},"ac":{"value":52,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":30}],"details":"magma glide"},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"physical","exceptions":["magic"]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":15,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":15,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["dwarven","petran","pyric","talican"],"details":""},"level":{"value":23},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>The Forgemaster is a primordial entity of creation who spends their days forging works of horrifying power and incredible beauty in equal measure. It is said that from their hands have sprung many of the greatest weapons known to both gods and mortals alike. They dwell among the primal magma that flows deep below the world's surface, thinking nothing of the heat or pressure as they endlessly toil.</p><p>Only the bravest, or most foolhardy, dare approach the Forgemaster to make requests. Legends say the Forgemaster destroys those who seek their creations for petty glory. They have no interest in accepting money as payment; instead, they demand that their would-be clients complete formidable trials to prove their resolve.</p><h2>One of a Kind</h2><p>The Forgemaster lives for the challenge of producing new, never-before-seen wonders. The Forgemaster never creates the same item twice and rarely adheres strictly to a recipe. Any item created by the Forgemaster usually has an extra, hidden property or two—a command word that unlocks a hidden power or a curse that affects those who prove themselves unworthy. A wielder might learn some of these properties only long after the item has left the Forgemaster's hands.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 20,000/48,000/90,000 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Arcana, Athletics, Crafting, Intimidation, Nature, Occultism, Religion)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, burning barbs, earth, earth armor, elongating, energy resistant (fire, vitality), fire, fire shield, intelligence, metal, sensory (darkvision), strength, sturdy, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Bryan Strahm","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":10},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":10},"wis":{"mod":9},"cha":{"mod":6}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":39,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"precise","range":120}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":40,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":34,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":37,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"arcana":{"base":41},"athletics":{"base":43},"crafting":{"base":46},"intimidation":{"base":39},"nature":{"base":40},"occultism":{"base":41},"religion":{"base":40}},"traits":{"value":["earth","elemental","fire","metal"],"rarity":"unique","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"_id":"sKFVjnck4SSE0wD0","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/forgemaster.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Forgemaster","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/forgemaster.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,